Seat Selection / Booking Page:
As a user, I want to view available and booked seats and select my preferred seats, so that I can make a booking for the session I want.

Booking Confirmation Page:
As a user, I want to see a confirmation summary with the movie, session time, selected seats, and payment details, so that I know my booking was successful.

My Bookings Page:
As a user, I want to view my current and past bookings in one place, so that I can keep track of my booking history and manage upcoming sessions.
